      13→✨ **`samber/lo` is a Lodash-style Go library based on Go 1.18+ Generics.**
      14→
      15→A utility library based on Go 1.18+ generics that makes it easier to work with slices, maps, strings, channels, and functions. It provides dozens of handy methods to simplify common coding tasks and improve code readability. It may look like [Lodash](https://github.com/lodash/lodash) in some aspects.
